# The canonical toolchain image only needs the pinned toolchain manifest, the
# Android SDK package metadata, and the two pubspec files used to prewarm
# PUB_CACHE. Excluding everything else keeps the build context at a few
# kilobytes instead of shipping the whole working tree (including Gradle and
# Flutter build directories) to the daemon on every image build.
**
!tools/reproducible-builds/TOOLCHAIN.env
!tools/reproducible-builds/sdk-metadata/**
!flutter_ui/pubspec.yaml
!flutter_ui/pubspec.lock
